---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
export function getStaticPaths(){return [undefined,'typing','shortcuts','settings','troubleshooting','recognition','development','story'].map(slug=>({params:{slug}}))}
const pages = [
{slug:'',en:'Getting started',zh:'開始使用',intro:'Your first words with Mousyst.',introzh:'用 Mousyst，輸入第一句話。',sections:[
['Download and open','下載與開啟','Download the Windows x64 ZIP from GitHub Releases. Extract the entire folder, then open MousystDesktop.exe. Keep the _internal folder beside the executable. Python is bundled; you do not need to install it.','從 GitHub Releases 下載 Windows x64 ZIP，解壓縮整個資料夾，再開啟 MousystDesktop.exe。請保留執行檔旁的 _internal 資料夾，不需要另外安裝 Python。'],
['Find Mousyst in the tray','在系統匣找到 Mousyst','The app starts in the Windows system tray with a white M icon. Right-click it to show the keyboard, open Settings, or Quit. Check the hidden tray icons if you do not see it.','程式啟動後會出現在 Windows 系統匣，圖示是白色 M。右鍵點擊可顯示鍵盤、開啟設定或結束程式。找不到時，請查看隱藏的系統匣圖示。'],
['Welcome card in MousystNext','MousystNext 的歡迎畫面','Launching MousystNext.exe shows a short guide. Click another window, press Esc, or choose Got it to dismiss it. To read it again, right-click the M in the tray and choose Welcome & tips.','啟動 MousystNext.exe 後會看到簡短的使用指南。點選其他視窗、按 Esc 或選擇 Got it 即可關閉。想再看一次，可在系統匣的 M 圖示上按右鍵，選擇 Welcome & tips。'],
['Type your first word','輸入第一個字','Click a text field in another application. Press the middle mouse button to summon Mousyst. Click letters, or hold the left button and glide through an English word. Release to enter it. Middle-click again to hide the keyboard.','先點擊其他應用程式的文字欄位，再按滑鼠中鍵叫出 Mousyst。可以逐鍵點擊，或按住左鍵滑過英文單字的字母，放開後輸入。再按中鍵即可隱藏鍵盤。'],
['What to expect','使用範圍','This is a Windows x64 desktop preview with offline English word recognition. It is intended for short replies, searches, and labels. It does not promise to be faster than a physical keyboard.','這是 Windows x64 桌面預覽版，支援離線英文單字辨識，主要用於簡短回覆、搜尋和命名，並未宣稱比實體鍵盤更快。']]},
{slug:'typing',en:'Typing & suggestions',zh:'輸入與候選字',intro:'Click precisely. Glide naturally.',introzh:'精準點擊，自然滑行。',sections:[
['Click or swipe','點擊或滑行','Click individual keys for names, unfamiliar words, or exact spelling. To swipe a word, hold the left button, trace its letters, then release. Repeated letters do not require a loop or pause.','人名、生字或需要精確拼字時，可以逐鍵點擊。滑行輸入時，按住左鍵依序滑過字母再放開；重複字母不需要繞圈或停頓。'],
['Zhuyin and more suggestions','注音與更多候選字','In MousystNext and the browser demo, click 注音 and tap or glide through the symbols, including tone marks. Lift after a syllable or trace the whole phrase, then confirm a candidate. Leave first tone unmarked. Try ㄕˋ for 是 or continue with ㄐㄧㄝˋ for 世界. Scroll over the strip to highlight a choice, then click it or press the on-screen Space key. Backspace edits the pronunciation. The arrow opens the full list. English swipes offer up to nine alternatives.','在 MousystNext 或網頁試用版點選注音，再點擊或滑過注音符號與聲調。可以逐音節滑行，也能一筆滑完整個詞，再確認候選字；一聲不加符號。輸入 ㄕˋ 可選「是」，繼續輸入 ㄐㄧㄝˋ 可選「世界」。在候選列上滾動可移動選取位置，點選候選字或螢幕空白鍵即可送出。退格可修改注音，箭頭可展開完整清單。英文滑行最多提供九個候選字。'],
['English apostrophes','英文撇號','Swipe D–O–N–T for “don’t”. When clicking individual letters, press Space to complete common contractions such as “you’re”. For ambiguous spellings such as “well”, swiping offers both “well” and “we’ll”.','滑過 D–O–N–T 即可輸入 don’t。逐鍵點擊時，按空白鍵可為 youre 等常見縮寫補上撇號。滑過 well 等有歧義的拼法時，可在候選列選擇 well 或 we’ll。'],
['Change a word','替換單字','Click an alternative in the suggestion bar, or hover over the bar and scroll. Alternatives replace the latest swipe word only while Mousyst can verify the destination and caret. Undo removes the latest entry; Backspace removes one character.','點擊候選字，或將游標移至候選列上滾動。只有能確認輸入欄位和游標位置時，才能替換上一個滑行單字。Undo 移除上一筆輸入，退格鍵刪除一個字元。'],
['Spaces and symbols','空白與符號','Recognized words receive an automatic space. Punctuation replaces that space where appropriate. Right-click a letter for its printed secondary symbol. ABC/123 replaces the letter area with symbols; choose Numpad for a numeric arrangement.','辨識後的單字會自動補上空白，適用的標點會取代這個空白。右鍵點擊字母可輸入標示的小符號。ABC/123 將字母區切換為符號區，選擇 Numpad 可改用數字鍵盤。'],
['Cancel a stroke','取消滑行','Press Escape or release outside the keyboard to cancel an unfinished swipe. Holding a letter or Backspace repeats it.','按 Escape 或在鍵盤外放開，可取消尚未完成的滑行。按住字母或退格鍵可以重複輸入。']]},
{slug:'shortcuts',en:'Shortcuts & caret',zh:'快捷鍵與游標',intro:'The familiar controls, a mouse click away.',introzh:'熟悉的操作，用滑鼠就能完成。',sections:[
['Use a shortcut','使用快捷鍵','Click Ctrl, Alt, Win, or Shift, then the target key. Modifiers apply to the next action. For example, Ctrl then C copies, Ctrl then V pastes, and Win + Shift then S requests the Windows screen capture shortcut.','先點擊 Ctrl、Alt、Win 或 Shift，再點擊目標鍵。修飾鍵會套用到下一個動作。例如 Ctrl 再 C 是複製，Ctrl 再 V 是貼上，Win 加 Shift 再 S 是 Windows 螢幕擷取快捷鍵。'],
['Use the Edit panel in MousystNext','使用 MousystNext 的 Edit 面板','Click Edit above the keyboard. Choose Previous word to move the caret, Select all to highlight the field, or App undo to undo in the destination app. Click Edit again to return to the letters.','點擊鍵盤上方的 Edit。Previous word 可移至上一個單字，Select all 可選取整個欄位，App undo 可在目標程式中復原操作。再點一次 Edit 即可回到字母鍵盤。'],
['Move the caret','移動文字游標','Tap Space to insert a space. Drag it left or right to move by character, or up and down to move by line. Moving the caret can invalidate word replacement suggestions.','輕點空白鍵輸入空白。按住並左右拖曳可逐字元移動游標，上下拖曳可逐行移動。移動游標後，單字替換候選可能會失效。']]},
{slug:'settings',en:'Settings & configuration',zh:'設定與自訂',intro:'Give your keyboard a familiar feel.',introzh:'打造順手的鍵盤。',sections:[
['Layout and appearance','版型與外觀','Open Settings using the keyboard gear or tray menu. Choose Compact, Standard, or Full, adjust size, and choose background and accent colors. Changes use graphical controls.','透過鍵盤的設定圖示或系統匣選單開啟設定。選擇精簡、標準或完整版型，調整大小、背景及主題色，透過圖形介面即可完成。'],
['Testing build: personal tools','測試版：個人工具','In MousystNext, open Edit to select or move by word. Open Shortcuts to run a favorite, or Phrases to insert a saved reply. Choose Manage in either panel to add or edit entries. Both lists are also available in Settings. The personal swipe dictionary saves English spellings and their capitalization, including names such as Mousyst.','在 MousystNext 中，開啟 Edit 可選取文字或逐字移動；Shortcuts 可執行常用快捷鍵，Phrases 可插入儲存的回覆。在任一面板點選 Manage 即可新增或編輯項目，也可以從設定管理這兩份清單。個人滑行詞庫會保留自訂英文拼字與大小寫，例如 Mousyst。'],
['Swipe learning in MousystNext','MousystNext 的滑行學習','Learning is on by default. Under Typing & Pointer, turn off Learn from my swipes to pause learning and use the default ranking. Choose Clear learning to erase learned preferences. Your personal dictionary is managed separately.','滑行學習預設開啟。在 Typing & Pointer 中關閉 Learn from my swipes，即可暫停學習並恢復預設排序。選擇 Clear learning 可清除學習紀錄；手動新增的個人詞庫另行管理。'],
['Interaction','操作設定','Adjust repeat timing, caret scrub sensitivity, and right-click symbols. Optional predictive aiming is off by default. Manual middle-click activation is the current behavior; automatic text-field opening has been removed.','可以調整按鍵重複時間、游標拖曳靈敏度及右鍵符號。預測點擊範圍預設關閉。目前採中鍵手動開啟，已移除文字欄位自動彈出功能。'],
['Import and export','匯入與匯出','Settings offers configuration import and export. The desktop configuration lives at %APPDATA%/Mousyst/settings.json. Keep a backup before experimenting with manually edited files.','設定介面提供設定檔匯入及匯出。桌面設定存於 %APPDATA%/Mousyst/settings.json。手動修改設定檔前，建議先保留備份。']]},
{slug:'troubleshooting',en:'Troubleshooting',zh:'疑難排解',intro:'A few things worth checking.',introzh:'遇到問題時，先看看這裡。',sections:[
['The keyboard does not appear','鍵盤沒有出現','Look for Mousyst in the system tray and use Show. Confirm that you extracted the entire download, including _internal. Middle-click is the manual show/hide control.','在系統匣找到 Mousyst 並選擇顯示。確認下載檔案已完整解壓縮，包含 _internal。滑鼠中鍵用來手動顯示或隱藏。'],
['An app does not accept input','應用程式無法輸入','Click the destination text field before summoning Mousyst. Some elevated or custom applications may reject injected input. Broad compatibility and mixed-DPI testing are still in progress.','叫出 Mousyst 前，先點擊目標文字欄位。部分具有較高權限或自訂輸入介面的應用程式可能拒絕輸入。目前仍持續測試不同應用程式與螢幕縮放比例的相容性。'],
['Suggestions are unavailable','候選字無法使用','Replacement is disabled when Mousyst cannot verify the text field or caret. Moving the caret or editing elsewhere may invalidate the previous word. You can still click keys for exact input.','無法確認文字欄位或游標時，會停用替換。移動游標或在其他位置編輯，可能使上一個單字失效。仍可逐鍵點擊輸入。']]},
{slug:'recognition',en:'How recognition works',zh:'辨識原理',intro:'A path becomes a word, locally.',introzh:'一道軌跡，在本機轉成文字。',sections:[
['From coordinates to candidates','從座標到候選字','The renderer and recognizer share keyboard coordinates. Completed paths are normalized and resampled. Endpoint and coarse-shape checks shortlist words before closer path comparison. Frequency provides a secondary ranking signal.','畫面與辨識器共用鍵盤座標。完成的滑行軌跡先經正規化與重新取樣，再透過端點及大致形狀篩選單字，接著進行更細緻的路徑比較，詞頻則作為次要排序依據。'],
['Offline vocabulary','離線詞庫','The app bundles up to 20,000 English words derived from wordfreq. Recognition runs away from the UI thread. No cloud language model is needed. Vocabulary attribution and license notices are included in the repository.','程式內附來自 wordfreq、最多兩萬個英文單字的詞庫。辨識在介面執行緒之外進行，不需要雲端語言模型。詞庫來源與授權聲明收錄於原始碼庫。'],
['How MousystNext learns','MousystNext 如何學習','If a swipe gives you “to” and you choose “too”, continuing to type in the same verified field confirms your choice. Corrections carry more weight than keeping the first suggestion. Mousyst also adjusts for a consistent offset at the start and end of your swipes.','假如滑行後出現 to，你改選 too，再於同一個可驗證的欄位繼續輸入，Mousyst 就會記住這次選擇。主動改選的候選字比直接接受首選更有分量。它也會依據滑行起點與終點的平均偏移微調辨識。'],
['Privacy and limitations','隱私與限制','MousystNext stores counts for up to 512 candidate words and one average pointer offset on your device. Learning skips password fields and unverifiable carets. Sentences, raw strokes and clipboard history are never saved by swipe learning. Unknown words remain enterable by clicking. Ambiguous paths may require choosing an alternative.','MousystNext 會在本機保存最多 512 個候選字的使用次數及一組平均偏移量。密碼欄位或無法驗證游標位置時會略過學習。滑行學習不儲存整句文字、原始軌跡或剪貼簿紀錄。詞庫以外的字仍可逐鍵輸入；模糊的軌跡可能需要手動挑選候選字。']]},
{slug:'development',en:'Build & contribute',zh:'建置與貢獻',intro:'Open source, from the keyboard up.',introzh:'從鍵盤開始，開放原始碼。',sections:[
['Run the desktop source','執行桌面原始碼','Use Windows x64 and Python 3.12. Install requirements-dev.txt, then run python src/desktop_app.py from the repository root. The source, tests, and issue tracker are on GitHub.','使用 Windows x64 與 Python 3.12。安裝 requirements-dev.txt 後，在原始碼庫根目錄執行 python src/desktop_app.py。原始碼、測試與問題追蹤皆位於 GitHub。'],
['Build and release','建置與發布','Run ./build-preview.ps1 -Desktop -BundleName MousystDesktop to create the portable package. GitHub Actions tests and builds main changes. Version tags publish releases after checks pass.','執行 ./build-preview.ps1 -Desktop -BundleName MousystDesktop 產生可攜式套件。GitHub Actions 會測試及建置 main 的變更，版本標籤則在檢查通過後發布版本。'],
['Report an issue','回報問題','Include your Windows version, Mousyst version, the destination app, steps to reproduce, and expected versus actual behavior. Avoid including private text or screenshots containing sensitive information.','請附上 Windows 版本、Mousyst 版本、目標應用程式、重現步驟，以及預期與實際結果。請避免附上私人文字或含敏感資訊的截圖。']]},
{slug:'story',en:'The project story',zh:'專題歷程',intro:'From a radial idea to a familiar layout.',introzh:'從放射式構想到熟悉的鍵盤。',sections:[
['The first experiment','第一個實驗','Mousyst began with a radial keyboard: choose a group, choose a letter, and return to the center. Early testers found the interaction slower than using one hand on a physical keyboard.','Mousyst 最初採用放射式鍵盤：選擇字母群組、選字母，再回到中心。早期試用者發現，這樣的操作比單手使用實體鍵盤更慢。'],
['Changing the interaction','重新設計操作','The project moved to stable QWERTY keys with click and swipe input. Later iterations added shortcuts, symbols, caret scrubbing, and a consistent dark interface. Feedback also led to reserved suggestion space and replacing, rather than expanding, the numeric layout.','專題改採固定 QWERTY 版型，結合點擊與滑行輸入。後續加入快捷鍵、符號、游標拖曳及一致的深色介面。根據回饋，也保留候選字空間，並將數字區改為原位切換。'],
['Where it is today','目前進度','The Windows desktop preview is available on GitHub. Open the browser demo to click letters, swipe English words, and try alternatives in the editor.','Windows 桌面預覽版已於 GitHub 提供下載。開啟網頁體驗版，即可在編輯區點擊字母、滑行輸入英文單字，並選擇候選字。']]}
];
const page=pages.find(p=>p.slug===(Astro.params.slug||''))!;
---
<Shell title={`${page.en} — Mousyst Docs`} docs><div class="docs-layout"><aside><div class="eyebrow">MOUSYST / DOCS</div><label class="search-label" for="docs-search" data-en="Find a guide" data-zh="尋找文件">Find a guide</label><input id="docs-search" type="search" placeholder="Search / 搜尋"/ ><nav aria-label="Documentation">{pages.map(p=><a class:list={[p.slug===page.slug&&'current']} href={`/docs/${p.slug?p.slug+'/':''}`} data-search={[p.en,p.zh,p.intro,p.introzh,...p.sections.flat()].join(' ').toLowerCase()} aria-current={p.slug===page.slug?'page':undefined} data-en={p.en} data-zh={p.zh}>{p.en}</a>)}</nav><p id="no-results" hidden data-en="No matching guides." data-zh="沒有符合的文件。">No matching guides.</p><a class="github-link" href="https://github.com/HarvyLiu/Mousyst">View on GitHub ↗</a></aside><article class="doc"><div class="eyebrow" data-en="Documentation / Desktop preview" data-zh="使用文件 / 桌面預覽版">Documentation / Desktop preview</div><h1 data-en={page.en} data-zh={page.zh}>{page.en}</h1><p class="intro" data-en={page.intro} data-zh={page.introzh}>{page.intro}</p>{page.slug===''&&<a class="button" href="https://github.com/HarvyLiu/Mousyst/releases/latest"><span data-en="Download Windows preview ↗" data-zh="下載 Windows 預覽版 ↗">Download Windows preview ↗</span></a>}{page.slug===''&&<a class="demo-link" href="/demo/" data-en="Try the browser demo →" data-zh="在瀏覽器試用 →">Try the browser demo →</a>}{page.sections.map(([en,zh,body,bodyzh],i)=><section id={`section-${i}`}><h2 data-en={en} data-zh={zh}>{en}</h2><p data-en={body} data-zh={bodyzh}>{body}</p></section>)}<div class="doc-end"><span data-en="Need more help?" data-zh="還需要協助嗎？">Need more help?</span><a href="https://github.com/HarvyLiu/Mousyst/issues" data-en="Open a GitHub issue ↗" data-zh="前往 GitHub 回報問題 ↗">Open a GitHub issue ↗</a></div></article><div class="toc"><span data-en="ON THIS PAGE" data-zh="本頁內容">ON THIS PAGE</span>{page.sections.map(([en,zh],i)=><a href={`#section-${i}`} data-en={en} data-zh={zh}>{en}</a>)}</div></div></Shell>
<script>document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#docs-search')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{const query=(e.target as HTMLInputElement).value.toLowerCase().trim();let count=0;document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('aside nav a').forEach(a=>{const match=(a.dataset.search || '').includes(query);a.hidden=!match;if(match)count++});(document.querySelector('#no-results') as HTMLElement).hidden=count>0});</script>
<style>.demo-link{display:inline-block;margin:12px 16px;color:var(--mint);font-size:13px}.docs-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,740px) 170px;gap:55px;max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding:55px 4vw 100px;min-height:80vh}aside{position:sticky;top:30px;align-self:start}aside .eyebrow{font-size:9px;margin-bottom:30px}.search-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:8px}input{width:100%;background:#1b201d;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:11px;font:12px inherit;margin-bottom:20px}aside nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;align-items:stretch}aside nav a{font-size:12px;padding:11px 12px;border-radius:4px;color:var(--muted)}aside nav a[hidden]{display:none}aside nav a.current{background:#24372b;color:var(--mint)}.github-link{display:block;font-size:11px;margin:35px 12px;color:var(--muted)}.doc h1{font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,60px);margin:25px 0;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.15}.intro{color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;margin-bottom:30px}.doc section{padding-top:22px;scroll-margin-top:25px}.doc h2{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin:25px 0 12px}.doc section p{color:#b3bcb5;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9}.doc-end{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:25px;margin-top:45px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.doc-end a{color:var(--mint)}.toc{position:sticky;top:40px;align-self:start;border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:18px}.toc span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:20px}.toc a{display:block;font-size:11px;margin:15px 0;color:var(--muted)}#no-results{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:1100px){.docs-layout{grid-template-columns:200px minmax(0,1fr);gap:35px}.toc{display:none}}@media(max-width:700px){.docs-layout{display:block;padding:30px 6vw 65px}aside{position:static;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:35px}aside nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.github-link{display:none}.doc-end{gap:15px}}
</style>
